config POWER_SEQUENCING_STINGRAY_BCM4329
    tristate "Stingray BCM4329 shared-resource prototype (experimental)"
    depends on POWER_SEQUENCING && OF && REGULATOR && COMMON_CLK
    help
      Source-only experiment using the upstream power sequencing framework.
      Requires explicit WLAN and Bluetooth consumer integration and correct
      ownership migration. Do not enable in the shipping kernel.
